CQ28: When did a broadcast take place?

SELECT ?broadcast ?timeInterval
WHERE {
  ?broadcast a :BroadcastingSituation ;
             core:hasTimeInterval ?timeInterval .
}

CQ36: Which are the members of a given music ensemble?

SPARQL-OWL formalisation (conceptual):

SELECT ?member WHERE {
  ?membership a :MusicEnsembleMembership ;
              :involvesMusicEnsemble <given_ensemble> ;
              :involvesMemberOfMusicEnsemble ?member .
}

:MusicEnsenble rdfs:subClassOf [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                  owl:onProperty core:hasMember ;
                                  owl:someValuesFrom :Musician
                                ] ,
                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                  owl:onProperty core:hasLeadMember ;
                                  owl:someValuesFrom :Musician
                                ] .

core:hasLeadMember rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                   rdfs:domain :MusicEnsenble ;
                   rdfs:range :Musician ;
                   rdfs:label "has lead member"@en ;
                   rdfs:comment "Specifies the lead musician (e.g., lead singer, lead instrumentalist) of a music ensemble."@en .
